  <description>Adventure through the seven provinces of Costa Rica as Teeko, a cute sloth tasked with defeating the rampaging gigante masks of Costa Rica’s Día de las Mascaradas festival. Jump, smash, and plant trees through the perfect mix of platforming and tower defense as you face hordes of enemies.</description>

